[h1]Languages[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/elytra-chestplate/README/README.html]EN/English[/url] | [url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/elytra-chestplate/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Elytra Chestplate[/h1]A Fabric mod that lets players combine a chestplate with an elytra in an anvil.
The result is a new chestplate item that keeps the armor properties of the original chestplate and can also be used for elytra gliding.
[h2]Features[/h2][list]
[*]Supports leather, copper, chainmail, iron, golden, diamond and netherite chestplates[/*]
[*]Combines a chestplate and an elytra in an anvil[/*]
[*]Keeps the chestplate's trims, durability, enchantments and other item data[/*]
[*]Ignores the elytra's durability, damage and enchantments[/*]
[*]Costs 0 XP[/*]
[*]Does not increase anvil prior-work penalty[/*]
[*]Can be worn as a chestplate[/*]
[*]Can be used for elytra gliding[/*]
[/list][h2]Supported Versions[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 1.21.11[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.18+[/*]
[*]Fabric API[/*]
[*]Java 21[/*]
[/list][h2]License[/h2]MIT
